，全家被无情灭族，血海深仇自此铭刻于心。五年后，他于磨砺中崛起，以圣皇之威凌世，霸气归来。往昔的悲痛与苦难，皆化作复仇的烈焰，他定要让仇人千百倍偿还，昭雪沉冤，重铸荣耀。","series_id":"7451926034959567896","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"202611062330526F9FBF1A12B30B9AC3E9\",\"rank\":\"4\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7451926034959567896\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"finish\\\":0.0007321814773604274,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.07224584370851517,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.05730456858873367,\\\"collect\\\":0.028870906680822372,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.72734135389328,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":0.7702351212501526,\\\"like\\\":0.0384662002325058}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7451926034959567896","play_cnt":28019,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"河马短剧","sub_title":"都市·都市玄幻","score":"8.1","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":92,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5022,\"name\":\"都市\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5022&categoryName=都市&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5073,\"name\":\"都市玄幻\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5073&categoryName=都市玄幻&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5092,\"name\":\"故人重逢\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5092&categoryName=故人重逢&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5158,\"name\":\"强者回归\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5158&categoryName=强者回归&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5175,\"name\":\"打脸反派\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5175&categoryName=打脸反派&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5224,\"name\":\"大男主\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5224&categoryName=大男主&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5319,\"name\":\"世家\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5319&categoryName=世